<title>JAPAN: Nihon Kohden - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nihon Kohden - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 20.35		vs	   15.86</p>
<p> Operating	  948    mln	  vs	  410    mln</p>
<p> Current		1.51		vs	  779    mln</p>
<p> Net		    1.13		vs	  655    mln</p>
<p> EPS		   24.11 yen	  vs	   14.66 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     47 million	  vs	  45 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nihon Kohden Corp is a specialist maker of electronic medical equipment.</p>
